{"wrong":"very agree","fix":"strongly agree","why":"'Very' cannot directly modify the verb 'agree'."}
{"wrong":"this restaurant food","fix":"this restaurant's food","why":"Use the possessive to identify food belonging to a specific restaurant."}
{"wrong":"not so good than","fix":"not as good as","why":"Equality comparisons use 'as...as' or 'so...as', not 'than'."}
